o class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/65536a15e73715acac02fe092de0aa39.poster.avif?t=1756488363\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/65536a15e73715acac02fe092de0aa39.webm?t=1756488363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/65536a15e73715acac02fe092de0aa39.mp4?t=1756488363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new abilities to overcome obstacles and reach the unreachable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dark Tale to Unravel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/213415a900a2b042ee9e13f087c74842.poster.avif?t=1756488363\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/213415a900a2b042ee9e13f087c74842.webm?t=1756488363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/213415a900a2b042ee9e13f087c74842.mp4?t=1756488363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mysteries and fate of a world ensnared by a cursed melody.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/9aa018089f0bde3cb02eddbd29f932f7.poster.avif?t=1756488363\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/9aa018089f0bde3cb02eddbd29f932f7.webm?t=1756488363\" type